        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-4">
          Unsupervised keyword extraction using TF × inverse-corpus-frequency scoring.
          Words rare in the TNC corpus score higher than common function words.
          Stopwords and single-character tokens are always excluded.
          Results are sorted by score descending.
        </p>
        <CodeBlock
          tabs={[
